            "answer": "grass",
            "options": [
              "barn",
              "cockerel",
              "cows",
              "crops",
              "fences",
              "fields",
              "grass",
              "hens",
              "lambs",
              "ripe",
              "tractor",
              "wheat"
            ]
          },
          ". As the plane nears the ground, you can see black-and-white ",
          {
            "type": "gap",
            "id": "7",
            "input": "select",
            "answer": "cows",
            "options": [
              "barn",
              "cockerel",
              "cows",
              "crops",
              "fences",
              "fields",
              "grass",
              "hens",
              "lambs",
              "ripe",
              "tractor",
              "wheat"
            ]
          },
          " standing in groups, and in the spring you can see sheep with their ",
          {
            "type": "gap",
            "id": "8",
            "input": "select",
            "answer": "lambs",
            "options": [
              "barn",
              "cockerel",
              "cows",
              "crops",
              "fences",
              "fields",
              "grass",
              "hens",
              "lambs",
              "ripe",
              "tractor",
              "wheat"
            ]
          },
          ". Every so often, there is a farmhouse with a ",
