              "fences",
              "fields",
              "grass",
              "hens",
              "lambs",
              "ripe",
              "tractor",
              "wheat"
            ]
          },
          " parked outside the door. Usually, there is an enormous ",
          {
            "type": "gap",
            "id": "10",
            "input": "select",
            "answer": "barn",
            "options": [
              "barn",
              "cockerel",
              "cows",
              "crops",
              "fences",
              "fields",
              "grass",
              "hens",
              "lambs",
              "ripe",
              "tractor",
              "wheat"
            ]
          },
          " nearby where the grain is stored. Outside, there are sometimes ",
          {
